WEBVTT

00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:11.340
Sosuke...

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:16.660
Chicken!

00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:20.100
What the heck do you take me for?

00:00:20.810 --> 00:00:23.250
I'm not the same sickly 
kid I used to be.

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:25.250
Shino!

00:00:25.470 --> 00:00:28.230
I've got Murasame, so I'll 
be fine! It's all cool!

00:00:28.230 --> 00:00:30.050
I'll be back in time for dinner.

00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:40.630
I'm back!

00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:48.270
Why...? Sosuke...!

00:00:48.670 --> 00:00:51.260
You jerk! What the hell was that for?!

00:00:52.210 --> 00:00:53.510
Wait just a damn second!

00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:58.030
H-Hamaji?! Why're you crying?

00:01:01.310 --> 00:01:04.140
I'm sorry... I had no idea.

00:01:04.820 --> 00:01:08.360
I thought I was in the forest 
for just a few hours.

00:01:09.240 --> 00:01:11.650
I didn't realize a whole week had 
passed outside of the forest...

00:01:12.740 --> 00:01:16.680
I'm sorry! I'll apologize, so, Sosuke...

00:01:17.620 --> 00:01:20.210
I've always been afraid...

00:01:20.930 --> 00:01:24.280
Afraid that you're going 
to leave me behind, Shino.

00:01:26.530 --> 00:01:27.450
I'm sorry.

00:01:27.930 --> 00:01:30.990
It's my turn to protect 
you and Hamaji...

00:01:31.670 --> 00:01:34.190
after all the times you've protected me.

00:01:36.130 --> 00:01:37.640
I swear I'll stay with you.

00:01:38.800 --> 00:01:40.200
You have my word...

00:01:51.230 --> 00:01:52.460
It's a promise.

00:01:56.280 --> 00:01:56.970
Yeah!

00:02:07.040 --> 00:02:08.700
That water was meant

00:02:08.700 --> 00:02:11.500
for naught but to turn you 
into the vessel for my child.

00:02:12.040 --> 00:02:16.490
It is a sacred water that 
buries the soul deep within.

00:02:17.420 --> 00:02:18.720
Sosuke...!

00:02:20.890 --> 00:02:23.280
Shino!

00:03:58.530 --> 00:04:03.460
Destiny

00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:11.020
Shino!

00:04:15.790 --> 00:04:17.840
Why are you glaring at me so?

00:04:18.550 --> 00:04:19.460
Ao?

00:04:50.200 --> 00:04:51.910
What's happening?

00:04:51.910 --> 00:04:54.310
Something is wrong with 
the spirit barrier...!

00:04:57.670 --> 00:04:59.310
Rio, hurry!

00:05:01.510 --> 00:05:03.690
Don't move, Rio!

00:05:09.560 --> 00:05:11.970
Have you failed to realize 
that in your desire

00:05:11.970 --> 00:05:14.050
to search for a stronger barrier,

00:05:14.050 --> 00:05:17.440
you are about to bring 
a horrible calamity down

00:05:17.440 --> 00:05:18.710
upon the Imperial Capital?

00:05:28.240 --> 00:05:34.220
May the land that slew my children 
fall into darkness and despair!

00:05:46.710 --> 00:05:47.490
Shino!

00:05:48.180 --> 00:05:50.240
So... Sosuke...

00:05:51.890 --> 00:05:53.730
Shino, hang in there!

00:06:06.570 --> 00:06:10.960
I... can't afford to die like this.

00:06:10.960 --> 00:06:12.510
Sosuke still needs...

00:06:35.470 --> 00:06:36.500
That's right...

00:06:37.270 --> 00:06:40.740
This is the woman who... killed us.

00:06:49.780 --> 00:06:52.370
It has been some time, Princess Fuse!

00:06:52.370 --> 00:06:53.680
Do you have any idea

00:06:53.680 --> 00:06:56.580
how eagerly I have awaited 
this very moment?

00:06:57.160 --> 00:07:00.290
Now I shall obtain your power!

00:07:39.460 --> 00:07:41.890
When it comes to you, Shino,

00:07:42.520 --> 00:07:44.900
I don't want to give up on anything.

00:07:46.340 --> 00:07:49.290
So...! Don't die...!

00:07:49.920 --> 00:07:51.060
Devotion

00:08:09.030 --> 00:08:10.020
Shino?

00:08:11.490 --> 00:08:13.430
Shino!

00:08:20.830 --> 00:08:22.060
Wh-what?!

00:08:27.960 --> 00:08:30.030
Duty

00:08:33.720 --> 00:08:34.910
What's goin' on?

00:08:42.890 --> 00:08:45.390
What a shame, Princess!

00:08:46.940 --> 00:08:49.920
Shino used his wish to revive Sosuke.

00:08:50.400 --> 00:08:53.190
That caused my gem to choose 
Sosuke all over again!

00:08:54.070 --> 00:08:54.920
Isn't that right?

00:08:58.910 --> 00:09:01.930
Sosuke, I'm so happy!

00:09:01.930 --> 00:09:04.540
You had me worried out of my mind!

00:09:04.540 --> 00:09:05.590
Hamaji...

00:09:07.210 --> 00:09:09.630
If you failed to wake up,

00:09:09.630 --> 00:09:11.940
I was of a mind to never forgive you!

00:09:12.210 --> 00:09:13.540
Same here!

00:09:13.540 --> 00:09:16.310
Do you have any idea how much 
work you've put me through?

00:09:16.310 --> 00:09:19.550
It has been a long time since we've 
felt butterflies in our stomachs!

00:09:19.720 --> 00:09:20.950
But this is a relief.

00:09:21.310 --> 00:09:24.960
Thank you, Sosuke, for 
coming back to us.

00:09:25.940 --> 00:09:27.100
I'm sorry...

00:09:28.560 --> 00:09:29.960
Where is Shino?

00:09:32.780 --> 00:09:35.510
Ever since you fell unconscious, 
Shii has been out

00:09:35.510 --> 00:09:37.300
searching for a man named Ao,

00:09:37.300 --> 00:09:39.600
so he could bring back your gem.

00:09:40.530 --> 00:09:41.450
My shadow...?

00:09:41.450 --> 00:09:42.600
That's right!

00:09:42.930 --> 00:09:46.170
I'm sure he must have worked 
hard to get that gem back!

00:09:46.170 --> 00:09:49.250
That's why you've 
regained consciousness.

00:09:56.840 --> 00:09:57.780
Shino...?

00:10:00.970 --> 00:10:02.370
Sosuke!

00:10:09.150 --> 00:10:11.650
What a devious child!

00:10:12.360 --> 00:10:15.310
Excellent. I like him 
all the more for it.

00:10:15.650 --> 00:10:19.370
I shall take him with me to 
serve as my child's vessel.

00:10:19.570 --> 00:10:20.710
What?!

00:10:21.370 --> 00:10:22.140
Ao!

00:10:24.870 --> 00:10:26.000
Sorry.

00:10:26.620 --> 00:10:28.360
I can't hand Shino over.

00:10:28.740 --> 00:10:30.900
You mean to defy me?

00:10:31.210 --> 00:10:34.900
If I let you have him, Shino 
will cease to be Shino!

00:10:36.550 --> 00:10:38.070
You are such a naughty child.

00:10:40.510 --> 00:10:42.660
Hazuki! Don't fight him!

00:11:01.160 --> 00:11:02.390
Satomi?

00:11:04.740 --> 00:11:05.680
Snow Princess!

00:11:24.700 --> 00:11:25.810
Keno...!

00:11:26.760 --> 00:11:27.730
Are you all right?

00:11:28.020 --> 00:11:28.700
Yeah...

00:11:34.710 --> 00:11:35.960
Shino!

00:11:40.650 --> 00:11:41.970
Shino...?

00:11:45.740 --> 00:11:47.470
What are you doing here?

00:11:48.500 --> 00:11:51.480
I swear, nothing seems 
to be going my way today.

00:11:58.260 --> 00:11:59.170
Shino...

00:11:59.170 --> 00:12:00.970
Need more...!

00:12:01.830 --> 00:12:02.830
Murasame?

00:12:02.220 --> 00:12:05.700
Need more! Need more blood!

00:12:11.060 --> 00:12:11.940
Shino!

00:12:12.730 --> 00:12:13.710
Shino!

00:12:15.980 --> 00:12:17.780
Murasame is going berserk.

00:12:18.230 --> 00:12:19.210
No...!

00:12:25.620 --> 00:12:26.760
What is that?!

00:12:27.080 --> 00:12:28.310
Is that Murasame?

00:12:28.310 --> 00:12:28.850
What?!

00:12:49.890 --> 00:12:51.830
I suppose it's time I left.

00:13:03.280 --> 00:13:04.800
Wait for me!

00:13:12.500 --> 00:13:13.580
Murasame...

00:13:21.630 --> 00:13:22.630
Keno!

00:13:24.470 --> 00:13:25.740
Stop it!

00:13:32.190 --> 00:13:35.120
At this rate, Murasame is going 
to completely absorb Shino!

00:13:37.310 --> 00:13:39.480
Murasame, stop it!

00:13:40.110 --> 00:13:41.880
Shinobu, look out!

00:13:42.280 --> 00:13:43.880
Give Shino back!

00:13:44.740 --> 00:13:45.860
Shino!

00:13:52.800 --> 00:13:53.850
Crap...

00:13:54.460 --> 00:13:56.890
Murasame, please calm yourself...

00:13:57.290 --> 00:13:58.150
Please...!

00:14:02.050 --> 00:14:04.280
Need more blood!

00:14:04.360 --> 00:14:05.680
Shino!

00:14:21.900 --> 00:14:22.980
Genpachi!

00:14:47.880 --> 00:14:50.750
I'd say things ain't lookin' 
too good for us about now...

00:14:51.760 --> 00:14:56.040
But the only way to save 
Shino is to stop THAT!

00:15:02.520 --> 00:15:05.360
Shino!

00:15:16.620 --> 00:15:17.790
Sosuke!

00:15:30.090 --> 00:15:32.530
Hey! How're we supposed 
to deal with that?

00:15:32.530 --> 00:15:33.640
Where is Shii?!

00:15:33.640 --> 00:15:36.850
Could he have been 
consumed by Murasame?!

00:15:40.390 --> 00:15:43.290
Are you in there, Shino?

00:15:44.320 --> 00:15:45.740
Sosuke...

00:15:51.410 --> 00:15:53.390
Sosuke, don't!

00:15:56.580 --> 00:15:57.870
Shino...?

00:16:00.410 --> 00:16:02.440
So...suke...?

00:16:07.760 --> 00:16:08.760
Yatsufusa!

00:16:10.630 --> 00:16:11.470
Goko Five Foxes!

00:16:11.470 --> 00:16:12.450
As you command!

00:16:41.290 --> 00:16:42.580
Shino...

00:16:44.000 --> 00:16:47.190
Doll... You stop that, you hear!

00:16:47.800 --> 00:16:50.190
Sosuke, that's enough!

00:16:53.930 --> 00:16:57.340
Shino, it's me! It's Sosuke.

00:16:57.920 --> 00:16:59.200
Do you recognize me?

00:16:59.970 --> 00:17:01.170
Run!

00:17:01.600 --> 00:17:03.940
Run, Sosuke...!

00:17:04.810 --> 00:17:08.120
Please take everyone and 
get away from Murasame.

00:17:09.070 --> 00:17:12.910
Thanks to you, Shino, I 
was able to come back.

00:17:14.360 --> 00:17:16.370
I'm all better now!

00:17:19.990 --> 00:17:22.170
I told you to get away from here!

00:17:23.710 --> 00:17:28.420
Shino, a long time ago, didn't 
you make me a promise?

00:17:28.880 --> 00:17:31.970
You swore that you would 
always be by my side...

00:17:33.470 --> 00:17:35.360
I won't let you claim 
that you've forgotten!

00:17:37.050 --> 00:17:40.370
Sosuke! I'm begging you! Run for it!

00:17:44.440 --> 00:17:46.870
Sosuke!

00:18:15.550 --> 00:18:16.470
Shino!

00:18:18.050 --> 00:18:19.050
Shino!

00:18:22.890 --> 00:18:24.220
Sosuke...?

00:18:24.890 --> 00:18:25.890
Shino!

00:18:26.390 --> 00:18:28.290
Shino, are you okay?

00:18:28.520 --> 00:18:32.540
Yeah. Like I was gonna 
swallow that nasty water.

00:18:32.730 --> 00:18:33.780
Shino!

00:18:33.780 --> 00:18:36.450
Ya rascal! You had us worried.

00:18:36.450 --> 00:18:37.360
Yeah.

00:18:37.360 --> 00:18:38.550
What a relief!

00:18:41.740 --> 00:18:43.080
I believed in you.

00:18:44.040 --> 00:18:46.560
I knew that you'd come 
back to us, Shino.

00:18:46.790 --> 00:18:50.060
Uh, Sosuke... I'm sorry.

00:18:50.830 --> 00:18:51.970
It was my fault that you...

00:18:53.750 --> 00:18:55.470
I'm not upset, not anymore.

00:18:55.470 --> 00:18:57.810
This has proven to be 
a good lesson for you.

00:19:00.340 --> 00:19:02.070
What's that supposed to mean?

00:19:03.180 --> 00:19:06.020
He was even able to overcome 
the Princess' water.

00:19:06.020 --> 00:19:08.020
I should have expected 
no less from Shino!

00:19:17.780 --> 00:19:21.320
My, my... It looks like 
he has calmed back down.

00:19:21.320 --> 00:19:22.320
Indeed.

00:19:23.580 --> 00:19:26.400
But, Brother, do you 
find this acceptable?

00:19:27.000 --> 00:19:29.100
The barrier has been undone...

00:19:29.250 --> 00:19:32.990
Well, I will simply have 
to start on my next plan.

00:19:33.380 --> 00:19:37.130
Fortunately, we have the Four Houses 
of the Sacred Beasts' children,

00:19:37.130 --> 00:19:39.520
each of whom are stronger 
than any spirit.

00:19:40.010 --> 00:19:41.340
Right, Nachi?

00:19:41.340 --> 00:19:45.120
What?! Don't tell me you want 
us to become the next sacrifice!

00:19:45.600 --> 00:19:47.020
I'm just pulling your leg.

00:19:50.480 --> 00:19:53.630
Coming from you, that 
doesn't sound like a joke!

00:19:58.150 --> 00:20:01.760
Man, I'm seriously feeling anemic here.

00:20:04.030 --> 00:20:05.360
I wanna eat some meat!

00:20:05.830 --> 00:20:08.290
I'm sure. Shall we head on back?

00:20:08.290 --> 00:20:09.020
Yeah...

00:20:23.770 --> 00:20:24.590
What is it?

00:20:26.850 --> 00:20:28.240
It really was you, wasn't it?

00:20:29.480 --> 00:20:30.400
Rio!

00:20:31.440 --> 00:20:32.370
Are you headed home?

00:20:32.770 --> 00:20:34.400
I'm returning to the church.

00:20:34.400 --> 00:20:37.130
I imagine those elders 
are too much for Nachi

00:20:37.130 --> 00:20:38.670
to handle by himself.

00:20:39.110 --> 00:20:42.540
Roger! I, for one, am 
going back to the manor.

00:20:42.990 --> 00:20:44.990
I'm sure Hamaji must be worried.

00:20:44.990 --> 00:20:46.010
Shino!

00:20:51.870 --> 00:20:52.710
Yeah!

00:21:49.850 --> 00:21:53.330
Master Ao, I picked this up for ya.

00:21:53.350 --> 00:21:58.330
Duty

00:21:54.940 --> 00:21:58.330
Thanks. It looks like I'll be 
starting over from scratch, huh?

00:22:00.070 --> 00:22:02.650
Master, yer awfully 
persistent, aren't ya?

00:22:04.070 --> 00:22:07.340
M-Master, c-can't breathe! 
That hurts, Master!

00:22:08.640 --> 00:22:10.850
Did you know that woman?

00:22:11.700 --> 00:22:12.850
What woman?

00:22:13.250 --> 00:22:15.790
That was the woman who killed us.

00:22:16.290 --> 00:22:20.090
But I've got this feeling 
I knew her before that...

00:22:21.050 --> 00:22:24.860
And back there, I remembered the 
song I used to sing with you...

00:22:30.180 --> 00:22:32.490
It is not the past that matters,

00:22:33.040 --> 00:22:34.740
but what lies ahead.

00:22:34.740 --> 00:22:35.770
What?

00:22:36.890 --> 00:22:38.980
All Eight Dog Warriors 
have gathered together,

00:22:38.980 --> 00:22:41.940
but something has taken the Gem of Duty.

00:22:42.570 --> 00:22:47.860
Shino, it is your job to set out 
once more and find that gem.

00:22:48.070 --> 00:22:49.490
What the hell?!

00:22:49.490 --> 00:22:52.390
Nothing has changed since you 
first gave me this assignment!

00:22:55.080 --> 00:22:56.640
That isn't true.

00:22:58.330 --> 00:23:01.170
We have friends with us now.

00:23:01.900 --> 00:23:03.150
Friends!

00:23:13.810 --> 00:23:14.990
True enough!

00:23:15.770 --> 00:23:19.980
Devotion

00:23:15.930 --> 00:23:19.620
All righty! I swear I'll find your gem!

00:23:23.360 --> 00:23:26.070
Fin
